<title>GERMANY: Italy's Ciampi says to seek ERM re-entry November.</title>
<headline>Italy's Ciampi says to seek ERM re-entry November.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi said on Friday that the Italian government would &quot;seek the re-entry of the lira into the ERM (Exchange Rate Mechanism) in November&quot;.</p>
<p>Speaking to journalists, Ciampi said he had &quot;no evidence&quot; that France or Germany were seeking to delay the timing of lira re-entry.</p>
<p>Ciampi had earlier given a speech to the European Banking Congress in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
